### Variables - Change these for different nodes
@nodeUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@nodeName = Anes
@receiver = Yasser
# For Bob use: http://127.0.0.1:8002
# For Charlie use: http://127.0.0.1:8003

### ============================================
### BASIC COMMANDS
### ============================================

### Get status
GET {{nodeUrl}}/status

### Get balance
GET {{nodeUrl}}/balance



### Create transaction (node → receiver, 10 coins)
POST {{nodeUrl}}/transaction/create?receiver={{receiver}}&amount=10

### Mine block
POST {{nodeUrl}}/mine

### Get blockchain
GET {{nodeUrl}}/chain

### Get mempool
GET {{nodeUrl}}/mempool